# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data files that are NOT redistributed with this repository.
#
# - The raw WVS Cross-National Wave 7 csv is distributed only under a
#   WVS consent form; do not commit it to the public repo.
# - worldvalues_real.csv is WVS-derived and must be reconstructed locally
#   by running pre-process/prepare_worldvalues_data.py.
# - pre-process/WorldValuesBench/ is an intermediate folder produced by that
#   script.
